WEBVTT

00:08:56.246 --> 00:09:00.954
and fail to help them to see these
emotions as inherently valuable.

00:09:03.412 --> 00:09:08.329
Normal natural emotions are
now seen as good or bad.

00:09:10.829 --> 00:09:15.162
And being positive has become a
new form of moral correctness.

00:09:17.912 --> 00:09:21.329
People with cancer are automatically
told to just stay positive.

00:09:24.829 --> 00:09:33.662
Woman to stop being so angry. And
the list goes on. It's attorney.